effort['tooling_changes']={'baseline':'8b85f19ce2d70988b0724f1d03e241c29a45daf6','shared_modeling_engine_modified':False,'conversion_or_renderer_modified':False,'experiment_specific':'Separate recipe builders; concept run adds nine-point, then25-point original armor shell cages using existing mesh/solidify functions. A new read-only cache-scene submission adapter calls unchanged native renderer APIs; it adds no rendering features.','fairness_limit':'The concept run had one more successful iteration, an extra failed attempt and more scripting/refinement time. Any quality advantage cannot be attributed to images alone.'}
